1
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:15,999
[Music] A thousand thanks to Mother and to the Lord Jesus This is the third time I am coming up on this altar to give testimony

2
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:30,999
For preparing me for this, I convey a billion thanks to my Mother My name is Ramya, this is my husband Satheesh Kumar, our home is in Harippad We are settled in the UK

3
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:47,999
I first made the covenant in July 2022 After that, in January 2023 we went to the UK From then on, we have been living completely under the care of Mother

4
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:58,999
Last March I came and gave a testimony After that, now urgently we came to India for an emergency It was last month in July—on the 7th of July—

5
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:09,999
My husband had a severe cardiac arrest in the UK I was on duty, I was on night shift then So my husband called me in the evening and said

6
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:15,999
Like this, I am getting chest pain After the chest pain, the pain is spreading like this to the jaw It is coming and going, it is staying

7
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:21,999
My husband has BP, but otherwise he is a man without any problems

8
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:27,999
When the pain suddenly came like that, I said, "If it is like that..."

9
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:31,999
I told him to go to the hospital, but I said it would take about 10–14 hours there to see a doctor in casualty.

10
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:40,999
To be seen. Since my husband had experienced that before, he was not willing to go; then my husband told me, "No problem, I'll be fine."

11
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:46,999
He said he had prayed — "we are praying here," so there is nothing to worry about. I said, "If there is any difficulty, come"

12
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:54,999
After that, my husband used the holy oil from our covenant, put holy oil on his chest, made the sign of the cross, recited the declaration of faith and prayed; the pain came and went.

13
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:01,999
The children were tucked in and everyone fell asleep; around one to three in the night my husband developed an extremely intense, crushing chest pain.

14
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:10,999
At that time no one noticed. Then suddenly, when my husband rose from the bed, the chest pain radiated to his arm and to his jaw.

15
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:17,999
It went to his jaw as well. His whole body shook violently; he suddenly went before Mother's image, took the holy oil, made the sign of the cross on his chest...

16
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:25,999
He recited the declaration of faith and prayed; then he lay down on the sofa in front of Mother and said, "Take care of it, Mother," and then...

17
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:33,999
He lay on the sofa. That night he did not call me; I was busy so I did not call back, thinking he must have been fast asleep.

18
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:39,999
Thinking there was no need to call, the next morning when I came he told me, "I had terrible chest pain last night, but I anointed my chest with holy oil and prayed."

19
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:46,999
After that Mother looked after him, but he said he still had pain that came and went, though there was no problem.

20
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:52,999
I said, "Let's go to the hospital in the morning." It was my third night shift and I was extremely exhausted; my husband said to me...

21
00:02:53,000 --> 00:03:00,999
He said, “No need, you just came back from night duty, go and sleep. If anything happens, I’ll call.” So the children went to school, only my husband was at home, and I went to sleep.

22
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:07,999
Then at around four in the evening, the children came back from school. We live in a semi-detached house, and we stay on the third floor.

23
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:12,999
There is no lift; it is a three-storey house. To open the main door, the children rang the call bell.

24
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:19,999
I did not know because I was asleep. My husband took the key and went downstairs. As he came down the steps, his body started collapsing.

25
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:30,999
My husband said it felt like all the air was leaving his body, like air or something was going out of his body, and he fainted onto the steps.

26
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:36,999
Then my husband sat on the steps there. Sitting there, he placed his hand on his chest.

27
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:42,999
He prayed, “Mother, please protect me,” and prayed reciting the declaration of faith. After sitting there for a while, the children were outside the door, I was in the room asleep.

28
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:48,999
In that building, there was no one else; everyone had gone to work. My husband was sitting alone on those steps.

29
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:53,999
He prayed there. After some time, my husband got up, went and opened the door, and let the children in.

30
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:57,999
The children did not know their father was in difficulty, they just ran upstairs.

31
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:04,999
My husband sat on those steps for a while longer. Then slowly, my husband said he does not know how, but someone supported him, and again he…

32
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:15,999
Climbed back up those three floors and reached upstairs. Truly, he said it felt like my Mother was holding and supporting him like this.

33
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:24,999
He came upstairs, I was sleeping, and he woke me and said, “Like this, I fainted, I became weak, but I don’t know how, Mother supported me.”

34
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:31,999
I asked, “How did you climb three floors again?” He said, “I don’t know, I was held and brought up.”

35
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:36,999
Then I immediately said, “Let’s go to the hospital.” But my husband did not like to go to that hospital.

36
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:40,999
He said there it is only waiting, waiting for so long is a terrible difficulty.

37
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:47,999
My husband said, “No, we will go at night.” But then Mother knew he must be taken to the hospital quickly.

38
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:53,999
Suddenly after calling a friend. The friend said, “With chest pain like this, you should be at the hospital. Get ready quickly, I will come and take you.”

39
00:04:54,000 --> 00:05:01,999
He came, quickly put him in the car, and took him to the hospital. When we reached there, the first ECG was taken.

40
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:06,999
Even then, the chest pain was coming and going. Then the first ECG was taken, blood was also taken.

41
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:13,999
By then, the troponin level, which should be below 100, was already showing 250. The ECG was also showing variation.

42
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:20,999
Then the doctor said, “This shows the symptoms of an attack. We must check every half an hour.”

43
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:31,999
So they quickly shifted us to CCU. Blood was checked, and with every test, it was increasing more and more.

44
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:37,999
Then after looking at all the other tests, the doctor came and told me, “Actually, yesterday a big massive cardiac arrest already happened.”

45
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:42,999
“Such a big attack already happened. Then again today my husband fainted.”

46
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:45,999
But the great wonder is, despite such a massive attack happening,

47
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:55,999
and even after collapsing like this, my husband is sitting without any problem now, they said. Then the doctor said, “We will admit and do an angiogram.”

48
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:57,999
They said, “We should do an angiogram and see.”

49
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:04,999
At that time my husband did not want to do the angiogram. He said, “I don’t need it, it’s enough if I go home.” Then he said, “Mother will protect me.”

50
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:07,999
“I have no problem. It’s enough if I go home. I don’t want to stay here.”

51
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:15,999
But immediately they admitted him, and when the blood was checked again, the level which was 250 had gone up to 750. Then the doctor said,

52
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:23,999
“A massive attack has happened. This is the window period before the next attack. If we don’t do something now, at the next attack he will die.”

53
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:29,999
“So you must do the angiogram as soon as possible,” they said. Then immediately they took him for the angiogram.

54
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:38,999
When they took him for angiogram, I had the holy oil in my hand. I anointed him with the holy oil, made the sign of the cross, and prayed as I sent him to the cath lab.

55
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:43,999
After they took him inside and did it, the doctor quickly came outside and told me—this was in my hospital itself—the doctor told me,

56
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:54,999
“Ramya, you must do bypass as soon as possible. Three vessels of your husband’s heart—the coronary arteries that supply blood to the muscle—

57
00:06:55,000 --> 00:07:04,999
are fully blocked. All arteries are 100% blocked. If we don’t do bypass quickly, he will die.”

58
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:11,999
“This is not like here in our country. In the UK, you may have to wait even one year to get a bed.”

59
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:16,999
“So we must arrange a bed quickly in another hospital.”

60
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:23,999
But still my husband was not agreeing at all. He said, “Mother will take care of me. I don’t need bypass. It’s enough if I go home.”

61
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:30,999
Then the doctor said, “If we send home a person in this condition, he will die with the next attack. So it must be done.”

62
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:36,999
“But in my hospital, cardiac surgery is not done. It has to be another hospital.”

63
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:45,999
Immediately they called there, arranged a bed, and sent all documents from here. The bed was ready within two days, and the doctors were willing.

64
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:52,999
But only my husband was not agreeing. Then people came for counseling and spoke with him, but my husband is such a person.

65
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:56,999
Then all of us asked, “Why don’t you agree?” Everyone said, “You are so young, if another attack

66
00:07:57,000 --> 00:08:02,999
comes, you will die. Don’t you need to take care of your children and wife? Why won’t you agree?”

67
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:09,999
He said, “Mother will protect me. I don’t want surgery. I will not agree.” Finally,

68
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:18,999
the doctors said, “If the patient is not willing, surgery cannot be done. Instead, we can put stents.” So they took him to put stents.

69
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:24,999
When they took him for stents, they found full blockages. The doctor said, “We will try to put the maximum stents possible.”

70
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:30,999
But they could put only two stents in the left coronary artery. At that time again my husband had chest pain,

71
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:33,999
and they said they cannot put the rest of the stents then, it would have to be done in stages.

72
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:39,999
When he was brought back to the room, even then my husband was praying, “Mother, please save me from here.”

73
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:43,999
Then the doctors said he cannot be discharged to go home, and they would not give travel allowance

74
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:49,999
to go to India. Because with pressure variation in a flight, his heart could burst and he would die.

75
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:58,999
In the system, they had documented that within months my husband would die.

76
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:02,999
Then I prayed to Mother, “My Mother, let me come and give testimony here. It is Mother who

77
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:08,999
has protected and cared for us all these days. Please don’t let my husband have even one more attack.”

78
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:16,999
After praying, my husband opened his mobile, and suddenly a class by a doctor from a hospital in Kozhikode appeared.

79
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:20,999
Then immediately he called and spoke to that doctor. He said, “This is my situation, I must be saved from here.”

80
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:26,999
That doctor said, “Don’t travel now. Wait three weeks, then you can travel.”

81
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:32,999
“Don’t travel while you are here now. After three weeks, travel and come to India, we will do the treatment here.”

82
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:40,999
Then from there he was discharged and we came home. But my husband was continuously having this chest pain.

83
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:44,999
Then suddenly doctors went on strike, and we could not go to the hospital or see anyone.

84
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:52,999
At that time, when I told my friends, everyone got angry at us for not doing the surgery already.

85
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:58,999
They asked, “Why are you standing with your husband in this decision?” I said it was because my husband didn’t know.

86
00:09:59,000 --> 00:10:05,999
But then we planned to go to India. When I said this, my department head and all the cardiologists came and told me,

87
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:15,999
“At any cost, don’t support your husband’s stand. If he boards the flight, you won’t land in Kochi. He will die on the way itself.”

88
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:21,999
“Every now and then we hear of people collapsing and dying from attacks on flights.”

89
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:30,999
Everyone told me, “You are seeing all this, don’t go, don’t go.” But my husband was holding on tightly to Mother and said, “We must go to our native place.”

90
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:38,999
So we booked the tickets. Before boarding the flight, we anointed with holy oil, recited the declaration of faith, and prayed.

91
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:42,999
I gave my husband the covenant medal from my neck, and told him to hold it tightly.

92
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:53,999
I told him, “When the flight takes off, I don’t know what may happen. Hold the covenant medal tightly, and call on Mother.” We applied the holy oil, gave honey on his tongue,

93
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:59,999
and all of us, with the children, stood around and prayed, holding on tightly that nothing should happen.

94
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:03,999
But after the flight took off and 10 minutes passed, I saw my husband sitting calmly without any problem.

95
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:08,999
My husband said, “Why are you afraid? Isn’t Mother with me? You don’t need to fear anything.”

96
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:12,999
Then we arrived here safely. The next day we came and prayed here.

97
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:21,999
From here, we collected the documents and gave them to Haripad Hospital and others. After that, we went to Kozhikode hospital and did an angiogram.

98
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:29,999
Even before the angiogram, when they did an echo, the doctor said, “There is something called EF (Ejection Fraction), the function of the left ventricle.

99
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:37,999
In the report you had sent from there, it was 55. But here it is 65. The left ventricle is pumping very well.”

100
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:42,999
Then, looking at the full reports, the doctor understood that there were complete blockages.

101
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:47,999
The doctor said, “We will try our maximum to remove these blockages, but we cannot guarantee anything.”

102
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:56,999
But after doing the angiogram, the doctor came to me and said, “I am doubting whether the reports you brought are really correct.

103
00:11:57,000 --> 00:12:06,999
Because the blockages shown there are not visible now. Only the two stents placed in the left coronary artery are there, and they are working well.”

104
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:14,999
“The right coronary artery is 100% blocked. Nothing can be done in that. But the miracle is—

105
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:25,999
normally in surgery, when bypass is done, a new artery is grafted to supply blood. But here, God Himself has created a new bypass.”

106
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:36,999
“Though the right coronary artery is 100% blocked, there is now a fully working bypass on the side, created by God Himself.”

107
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:43,999
The doctor said, “Even I am amazed. Looking at this heart, no one would believe it had such a massive attack.

108
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:51,999
The heart is pumping well, only one small block remains. For that, we can just put one stent. Nothing else needs to be done.”

109
00:12:52,000 --> 00:13:11,999
The doctor himself said, “It is good you did not do bypass." I then understood why husband opposed bypassing, it was a message from the Blessed Mother. Doctor said, "If bypass had been done, this well-working heart would have rejected it,"

110
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:25,999
the graft would have been rejected, the heart would have gone into failure, and your husband would have died. This is a heart that must not be bypassed at any cost.”

111
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:32,999
“There is absolutely no problem. It is working 100%. Looking at this heart, no one would believe it had a massive attack.”

112
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:41,999
Medicines were also reduced. While we were admitted there, we had taken newsletters from here to Kozhikode and gave them to everyone there.

113
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:47,999
Then the nursing manager there came to the room to see us and to know the patient’s status.

114
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:55,999
While talking, we came to know that she too had taken the covenant here. The nursing manager then told us…

115
00:13:56,000 --> 00:14:04,999
While talking, when we gave the blessed medal, the next morning we had to travel by Vande Bharat. Since it is only three and a half hours’ travel, the ticket was already booked.

116
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:10,999
In the morning, when we went to pay the bill, due to the credit limit, we couldn’t pay. They said only if we paid, they would discharge us.

117
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:15,999
By then it was nearing 8:00, and we had a train at 9:00. At that time this sister

118
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:20,999
suddenly came to see us like she was sent by the Blessed Mother. She said, “I thought I should see you”

119
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:33,999
We told her we were unable to pay the bill. Immediately she went to Finance, took money from her own account, paid the bill, closed it, and quickly arranged a vehicle.

120
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:38,999
She sent us straight to the railway station. We immediately returned to our native place.

121
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:49,999
Truly speaking, my husband should have died. But he is still with me, healthy, only because of my covenant prayer and Mother’s mercy.

122
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:59,999
Whenever we talk about works of mercy, we always take the prayer newsletters from here, give them to friends, and also to the church we attend there.

123
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:09,999
For my patients too, I pray. I recite the declaration of faith for them, pray for their sufferings, and try to be with them in their pain.

124
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:14,999
Whatever help we can do for others, we try to do.

125
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:21,999
So when I came here, I had already decided: I will not go back without giving this testimony. Because this is such a great miracle.

126
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:27,999
Every day in the world we hear of people collapsing and dying… collapsing and dying… dying from attacks in their sleep.

127
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:36,999
My husband too had an attack at 3 a.m. in his sleep, then collapsed the next day. But both times, my Mother completely protected him, that’s why he survived.

128
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:42,999
Today he is still standing with me in good health. So I prayed to Mother that I must give this testimony here.

129
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:51,999
After that, I had a check-up at Amrita, after my surgery. During the check-up, suddenly they said I urgently needed another surgery.

130
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:55,999
This was totally unexpected for us. Today is the fifth day after my surgery.

131
00:15:56,000 --> 00:16:01,999
I had not gotten up from bed all these days. I had vomiting and dizziness.

132
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:06,999
Whenever I tried to get up, I felt like vomiting and dizzy. So I would just drink a little hot water and lie back down. That was all.

133
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:12,999
Even yesterday and the day before, I was praying with the holy oil on my stomach, reciting the declaration of faith, asking Mother:

134
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:17,999
“Before I leave—this Monday we are going back—before leaving, somehow make it possible for me to come here and give my testimony.

135
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:27,999
Let me not feel dizzy when I stand at the altar. Let me not faint. Let me be able to stand here and give my testimony before going.”

136
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:33,999
That was my prayer. This morning, when I got up, I felt a slight dizziness, but it immediately disappeared.

137
00:16:34,000 --> 00:16:39,999
I prayed to Mother, “Mother, please make it possible for me to reach and give testimony here.” And I was able to come here.

138
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:44,999
All this time I have had no dizziness, no vomiting, and with good health I was able to give this testimony.

139
00:16:45,000 --> 00:16:50,999
For that I thank my Mother and Holy Son a thousand times.

140
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:58,999
From 2022 we have been in the covenant. From then onwards, in every step of our life, we never knew what would happen next.

141
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:06,999
But Mother knew everything fully, and went ahead of us, arranging all things.

142
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:13,999
When we are in the covenant, we fully realize this. Now I have no fear about anything, because Mother is holding us close.

143
00:17:14,000 --> 00:17:20,999
As it is said in Psalm 91: “He will cover you with His feathers, under His wings you will take refuge.”

144
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:33,999
“No enemy will touch you, no harm will come near you. He has commanded His angels to guard you, so that your foot may not strike against a stone.”

145
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:36,999
This means Mother is fully interceding for us.

146
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:42,999
So when we are in the covenant, we need not fear anything. This is what I have learned through my covenant life.

147
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:52,999
Now we have no worries at all about the future. We fully believe that Mother will protect us in every moment ahead.

148
00:17:53,000 --> 00:17:56,999
We have complete faith that she will keep us safe in all things.

149
00:17:57,000 --> 00:18:02,999
For being able to come here, stand, and give this testimony all this while, I offer a thousand thanks to my Mother. My husband too is fully healthy…

150
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:09,999
I thank Mother for giving him back to me. From now on, whenever we come here during any vacation, our only prayer is that we may stand at this altar and give testimony.

151
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:17,999
May God bless us to always remain eternal witnesses of Mother.

152
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:26,999
Gospel of St. John, chapter 15, verse 4: “Abide in me, and I in you. As the branch

153
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:36,999
cannot bear fruit by itself unless it abides in the vine, neither can you unless you abide in me.”

154
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:58,999
Dear ones in Jesus, Ramya from Haripad testified here today about the great grace given to her husband and the transformation in her family life.

155
00:18:59,000 --> 00:19:03,999
In their covenant life, they lived faithfully.

156
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:13,999
With zeal, they proclaimed the apostolic mission to those who did not know it. When her husband was thought

157
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:30,999
to be dead, the Blessed Mother gave him a new heart, created a new route, and restored his heart fully.

158
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:39,999
A perfect heart without any defect—Mother gave him a new heart. This is the power of faith in the Blessed Mother.

159
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:46,999
Afterwards, to settle the hospital bill, Mother arranged a sister to come forward.

160
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:57,999
When we recall the countless works of the Blessed Mother, no matter how many testimonies we share, it will never be enough. No matter how much we thank, it will never be enough.

161
00:19:58,000 --> 00:20:02,999
This is our pilgrim Mother. She removed her fears.

162
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:10,999
Just five days after her own surgery, when she was in no condition to even stand, Ramya prayed to Mother: “Mother, I am vomiting,

163
00:20:11,000 --> 00:20:21,999
but I must go and tell people that you gave my husband a new heart. Please prepare me to stand before you and speak.”

164
00:20:22,000 --> 00:20:27,999
That same Ramya, who could not even stand, is here before us at the altar giving testimony.

165
00:20:28,000 --> 00:20:37,999
All this is the Blessed Mother’s doing—she walks ahead of them, protects them from all harm.

166
00:20:38,000 --> 00:20:41,999
This is a living covenant testimony.

167
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:55,999
Before going to Kozhikode for stent placement, they first came to the Kreupasanam, took the newsletters, and gave them in the medical college at Haripad.

168
00:20:56,000 --> 00:21:08,999
After testifying to everyone there, they went to Kozhikode. And there, Mother showed the doctors the new heart she had given.

169
00:21:09,000 --> 00:21:22,999
The Blessed Mother promises: “I will encamp around your house and guard it. No enemy will overcome you anymore. My eyes are upon you.”

170
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:32,999
For this immense grace given through the Blessed Mother by Jesus, we offer a thousand crore thanks.

171
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:35,999
With gratitude, let us offer this testimony to Jesus. Let’s clap our hands.

